id: 15
ts: 2026-05-29T00:11:00Z
relevance: HIGH
title: CodeScene Code Health Metrics and Thresholds
authors: Adam Tornhill / CodeScene AB
year: 2020
venue: CodeScene Enterprise Documentation
quality: INDUSTRY
url: https://docs.enterprise.codescene.io/latest/guides/technical/code-health.html
keywords: CodeScene, Brain Method, God Class, hotspot, cyclomatic complexity, nesting depth, code health, code smells
cites: McCabe cyclomatic complexity, Cognitive complexity (Campbell)
cited_by:
content:
  BRAIN METHOD / GOD FUNCTION definition:
    A complex function that centralizes behavior and becomes a local hotspot.
    COMPOUND RULE: requires ALL of:
      (a) Lines of code > threshold (function is large)
      (b) Cyclomatic complexity > threshold
      (c) Deeply nested logic (nesting depth > threshold)
      (d) Centrality: the function is called/referenced by many other parts
    Config key: function_cyclomatic_complexity_warning (example default: 12)
                function_nesting_depth_warning (example default: 3)
  
  BRAIN CLASS / GOD CLASS:
    A module meeting all of:
      (a) Many lines of code
      (b) Many functions
      (c) Contains at least one Brain Method
  
  COMPLEX METHOD:
    High cyclomatic complexity from conditionals.
    Threshold: configurable. Example: 10 warning.
  
  NESTED COMPLEXITY:
    if-statements inside other if-statements and/or loops.
    Separate from cyclomatic complexity; targets structural depth.
  
  BUMPY ROAD:
    Multiple dispersed "humps" of indented code within a function —
    function has several loosely related logical sub-blocks separated
    by flat code. Each "hump" = a distinct responsibility cluster.
    Detected by: counting transitions from low-nesting to high-nesting
    regions within the function body.
  
  COMPLEX CONDITIONAL:
    Multiple AND/OR operators in a single branch expression.
  
  CODE HEALTH SCORE:
    Functions are scored 1-10 (10 = excellent). Score is a composite.
    Files with more lines get more weight in aggregate health calculation.
    Alert triggered when health declines by >= 0.1 points.
  
  CONFIGURATION FILE: .codescene/code-health-rules.json
    Example override:
      { "thresholds": { "function_cyclomatic_complexity_warning": 15,
                        "function_nesting_depth_warning": 4 } }
<<<END>>>

